    "Bootstrap 3 responsive visibility utilities (hidden-xs, visible-xs, hidden-sm, hidden-md, visible-md) toggle compact dropdown navigation vs full multi-column portlet grids.",
    "File-storage AngularJS toolbar collapses action icons into context menus (rightClick.js + popUps.js) on narrow viewports."
  ]
